*Presenter: be ready to explain and answer questions about every completed story, including work you didn't build.*

### Issue #1: *Grid movement*

[Check] Given I’m not stuck, when that I press W / A / S / D, then I will move up / left / down / right
[Check] Given that I’m in the game, when I walk into a wall, obstacle or closed door, then I will be stopped and not go through it
[Check] Given that I do not have a speed effect applied, when I walk, then my speed will be constant

### Issue #9: *Doungen generation*

[Check] Given a player enters a dungeon, when they enter a room, then it should be different from the last time they entered the same room
[Check] Given a player enters a dungeon, when they enter a room, the enemies should be a similar difficulty to the last time they entered the same room
[Check] Given a player enters a room, when they have been in that room before, any loot they collected should no longer be there.

### Issue #19: *Starting screen*

[Check] Given a user opens the game, when they load in, then they should be shown the starting screen
